cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and keep each entry's review state with it."
title: "Assuming RH: a map of theorems conditional on the Riemann Hypothesis"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Jaz"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RiskAverseTech/assuming-rh"
url: "https://riskaversetech.github.io/assuming-rh/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: 2026-11-21
abstract: >-
  An open dataset recording, for theorems proved assuming the Riemann
  Hypothesis or a generalization, exactly which hypothesis each proof uses,
  and whether the proof announced in November 2026 would make the result
  unconditional. Entries are drafted by an AI system and labeled with their
  review state.
keywords:
  - Riemann Hypothesis
  - generalized Riemann hypothesis
  - number theory
  - conditional theorems
